  Completion is persisted before input deletion, extras run after queue advancement, and merge pause/delete paths use `_mergingCid` / `_mergeDeleted`.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 11 — local library boxes included in storage lifecycle
  `LocalLibrary.boxes` is included in export/import/compact/close/clear via `lib/utils/storage.dart:82`.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 12 — local intro index fallback fixed
  If the current local entry is absent from the download list, the controller now falls back to just that entry before indexing.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 13 — plain local progress key fixed
  Plain local files now use an md5 path-derived key, and unknown duration no longer forces resume to zero.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 14 — offline comments panel keyed/null-guarded
  `LocalReplyPanel` is keyed by path and the call site handles null `localCommentsPath`.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 15 — quick-fav only toggles default folder
  The quick action now edits `LocalLibrary.defaultFolderId` while preserving other folder memberships.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 16 — local fav no longer changes public count
  `_onLocalFavChanged` now only updates local state, not the displayed server favorite count.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 17 — running Windows instance open-with handled
  `windows/runner/main.cpp` forwards file paths with `librepili-open:`, and `app_scheme.dart` opens them via `LocalPlayer`.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 18 — dialog controller lifetime fixed
  The folder-name dialog now owns its controller in a `StatefulWidget` and disposes it with the widget.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 19 — XML danmaku parse hardened
  `ctime` parsing now uses `int.tryParse`, so one malformed field no longer drops the whole XML file.

- [RESOLVED] Finding 20 — filename truncation hardened
  Export names are truncated by code point and shortened to reduce long-path risk.

- [RESOLVED] R1 — exported video deletion is opt-in
  Delete dialogs add an unchecked “同时删除导出的视频文件” option and pass `deleteExported` through single, page, search, and multi-delete paths.

- [RESOLVED] R2 — self-test profile isolated
  `--selftest` now redirects app support and download paths to a selftest profile before storage init.

- [PARTIAL] R3 — Type1/FLV handling mostly fixed, but multi-segment MP4 is not joined
  FLV AVC/AAC remux and tests were added, and all durl segments are downloaded. However `_exportType1()` exports non-FLV multi-segment inputs as separate files (`<base>.mp4`, `<base>.2.mp4`) instead of joining into one timeline-ordered MP4 at `lib/services/download/download_service.dart:676`.

- [PARTIAL] R4 — offline panel is network-free, but image saving fails
  Avatars were replaced with placeholders and rendering uses local files only. `CommentImages.save()` writes to `comments_images/<hash>.part` without creating `comments_images/`, so picture/emote downloads fail unless the directory already exists (`lib/services/download/download_extras.dart:489`).

- [RESOLVED] R5 — hide-interaction scope expanded
  The fix gates common reply FABs, live send UI/menu/header controls, video danmaku shortcut, reply-reply, and PGC review writing behind `LoginPolicy.canInteract`.

- [PARTIAL] R6 — platform rename mostly done, but iOS product name remains Runner
  Linux and macOS identifiers/names and CI artifact names were updated. iOS bundle/display names changed, but `PRODUCT_NAME` still expands to `$(TARGET_NAME)` in all iOS build configs (`ios/Runner.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj:391`).

- [RESOLVED] R7 — unused imports removed
  The fork-touched unused imports shown in the request were removed. I could not rerun `dart analyze` here because `dart` is not on PATH in this shell.

TOTAL: ROUND-NEEDS-FIX
